==Battleground==
*1 [[Lowkey]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*5 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*8 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Zollow]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*7 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*3 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Zollow]] spawns after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage hinges around outlasting the peon waves long enough to be able to destroy Lowkey. Because the threats spawn instantly instead of on base hit, bringing a [[Battle Items#Rich Cat|Rich Cat]] to help during the beginning may be a good idea.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Ancient Egg: N112 (Rare Cat)|Cat Egg Pod]]: Has high health and high damage, letting them get a hit in to cripple a peon and then tank attacks for other Cats. They may be immune to the Death Surges of the Condemned Pengs, but they are still vulnerable to the Zollows' Toxic.
*[[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]]: While he does not outrange Lowkey, he can absolutely halt his and the Pengs' progress. His Surge also allows him to snipe the Zollows, Gabriels, and Doge Darks, keeping him safe for longer. His strong against Aku and Relic also makes him a really useful asset here.
*[[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]: Outranges Condemned Peng and can deal huge damage with her Savage Blow [[Talents|Talent]]. She can also Z-Kill the Zollows, which makes her a great pick here.
*[[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]]: A great attacker for Lowkey when he's entirely alone. Even if you miss the opportunity to chain Lowkey with her at the beginning, she can still provide value by rushing in and getting off a few attacks.

